			<<link [[공간을 좀 치워본다 (0:20)|Asylum Depths Office 1 Clear]]>><<pass 20>><</link>><<housekeepingdifficulty 1 100>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $asylum_office is 2>>
